  "title": "Entergy Texas provides $500,000 in summer bill relief to help vulnerable customers",
  "summary": "For many of our neighbors, summer doesn’t just bring higher temperatures, it brings higher electricity use. Extreme heat often means running air‑conditioning longer and harder, which can lead to higher energy bills. For those on fixed incomes, higher summer bills can mean making difficult choices between paying for basic needs and keeping their homes cool.",
